================================================================
PASO 1 — INSPECCION DEL PIPELINE ACTUAL
================================================================

    Current probability source:
      predict_proba() → softmax(dim=1); P(class_1) = [:, 1]
      (app/ml/models/sequence_base.py)

    Current classification method:
      predict() → probs.argmax(axis=1)  (two-class softmax)

    Current threshold: 0.50 (argmax equivale a threshold 0.50)

    Current metric calculation path:
      accuracy/precision/recall/f1 → predict() (clases binarias)
      roc_auc  → roc_auc_score(y_true, probabilities)
      pr_auc   → average_precision_score(y_true, probabilities)

================================================================
PASO 2 — FUNCION REUTILIZABLE classify_with_threshold
================================================================

Implementada en app/ml/training/compare.py:

    def classify_with_threshold(probabilities, threshold):
        """P >= threshold → 1 ; P < threshold → 0.
        Valida que threshold este en [0, 1]."""

    Ejemplo (threshold = 0.50):
      P = [0.20, 0.42, 0.50, 0.61, 0.83]
      pred = [0, 0, 1, 1, 1]

Tambien se anadio metrics_at_threshold(y_true, probabilities, threshold),
que calcula accuracy/precision/recall/f1 con la clasificacion binaria y
roc_auc/pr_auc con las probabilidades, ademas de positive_predictions y
predicted_positive_rate (para detectar thresholds degenerados). Usa
zero_division=0.

